reaker and Teravolt.", effectChanges = {}, generation = "generation-v", id = "TURBOBLAZE", name = "Turboblaze", shortEffect = "Bypasses targets' abilities if they could hinder or prevent moves.", slug = "turboblaze", speciesCount = 2 },
  UNAWARE = { abilityId = 109, behaviour = { chance = 100, effects = { { kind = "other", what = "ignores other Pokémon's stat stage changes when calculating damage and accuracy" } }, expressible = false, notes = "No 'ignore stat modifiers' effect kind exists. Does not affect Speed, Punishment/Stored Power power calculation, or self-inflicted confusion damage.", scope = "self", trigger = "passive" }, effect = "This Pokémon ignores other Pokémon's stat modifiers for the purposes of damage and accuracy calculation. Effectively, this affects modifiers of every stat except Speed. The power of Punishment and Stored Power is calculated as usual. When this Pokémon hurts itself in confusion, its stat modifiers affect damage as usual.", effectChanges = {}, generation = "generation-iv", id = "UNAWARE", name = "Unaware", shortEffect = "Ignores other Pokémon's stat modifiers for damage and accuracy calculation.", slug = "unaware", speciesCount = 15 },
